{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe8; /* warm earthy */
      --card:#fff6ee;
      --muted:#6b5b4b;
      --accent:#8a5a3b;
      --accent-2:#c07b53;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--muted);}
    /* subtle patterned header using an external svg path reference (assets/img/pattern.svg) */
    header{
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(138,90,59,0.06), rgba(192,123,83,0.04));
      padding:28px 20px;
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(138,90,59,0.06);
    }
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:0.95rem}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;align-items:start}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(98,75,63,0.06);}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:1.6rem}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}
    label{display:block;margin:10px 0 6px 0;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(107,91,75,0.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:0.95rem}
    textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
    .small{font-size:0.85rem;color:#7a6a5b}
    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Session planner + wizard styles */
    .planner .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(138,90,59,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(138,90,59,0.06);margin-right:8px;font-size:0.85rem}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(107,91,75,0.06);min-height:80px}
    .wizard-step{display:none}
    .wizard-step.active{display:block}
    .steps-indicator{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .step-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(107,91,75,0.12)}
    .step-dot.active{background:var(--accent)}
    .important{background:#fff4e8;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(192,123,83,0.06);}

    @media(max-width:900px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">Confidential practice — membership support available</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="about.html">Therapist</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Reach out for a consult</h1>
          <p class="lead">If you're considering ongoing support or a trial membership plan, use the contact form below or try the Session Planner and Self-Screening tools to prepare for a conversation.</p>

          <form id="contactForm" class="contact-form" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First and last" required />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />

            <label for="message">Brief note — what would you like to focus on?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="One or two sentences about why you're reaching out"></textarea>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="primaryContact">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="clearForm" type="button">Clear</button>
            </div>
            <p class="small" style="margin-top:12px">I will reply to new inquiries within 3 business days during normal business hours. If this is urgent, please use local emergency services or crisis lines — I cannot provide emergency care via email. I value confidentiality; messages sent by email are protected within standard secure practice protocols but are not the same as a secure patient portal communication.</p>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h2>
          <p class="small">Build a short plan for the kinds of sessions you'd like. This creates a simple, shareable summary you can copy into a message or bring to an initial consult.</p>

          <div class="planner">
            <label for="focus">Primary focus</label>
            <select id="focus">
              <option value="Stress and routine overwhelm">Stress and routine overwhelm</option>
              <option value="Relationship patterns">Relationship patterns</option>
              <option value="Grief and loss">Grief and loss</option>
              <option value="Transitions (work, family)">Transitions (work, family)</option>
              <option value="Anxiety or worry">Anxiety or worry</option>
              <option value="Mood concerns">Mood concerns</option>
              <option value="Other">Other</option>
            </select>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label>Session rhythm</label>
              <div class="row">
                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="rhythm" value="Weekly" checked /> Weekly</label>
                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="rhythm" value="Biweekly" /> Biweekly</label>
                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="rhythm" value="Monthly" /> Monthly</label>
                <label class="pill"><input type="radio" name="rhythm" value="Short series (4-6)" /> Short series (4-6)</label>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label style="margin-top:10px">Goals for the next 2–3 months</label>
            <input id="goal1" placeholder="Goal 1 (example: improve nightly routine)" />
            <input id="goal2" placeholder="Goal 2 (optional)" />

            <label style="margin-top:10px">Barriers or constraints to plan</label>
            <select id="constraints">
              <option value="Scheduling / time">Scheduling / time</option>
              <option value="Cost concerns">Cost concerns</option>
              <option value="Privacy / confidentiality worries">Privacy / confidentiality worries</option>
              <option value="Preference for short term work">Preference for short term work</option>
              <option value="Other">Other</option>
            </select>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="buildPlan">Create plan</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="resetPlan" type="button">Reset</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="copyPlan" type="button">Copy summary</button>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="summary" id="planSummary" aria-live="polite">Your session plan will appear here.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Self-Screening Intake Wizard</h2>
          <p class="small">A non-diagnostic guided checklist to help you clarify what to bring to a consultation. It will produce prompts and suggested questions you might want to ask. This is not a diagnosis or a substitute for assessment; it simply organizes what matters to you right now.</p>

          <div id="wizard">
            <div class="steps-indicator" id="stepsIndicator"></div>

            <div class="wizard-step active" data-step="0">
              <label>What made you seek support now?</label>
              <textarea id="w0" placeholder="Describe the recent triggers or turning points"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="1">
              <label>Current experiences — what are the main things you notice (thoughts, feelings, behaviors)?</label>
              <textarea id="w1" placeholder="Three short notes, e.g. trouble sleeping, withdrawing socially, frequent worry"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="2">
              <label>What has helped before, if anything?</label>
              <textarea id="w2" placeholder="Supports, strategies, or past therapy that helped"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="3">
              <label>What worries you about starting therapy?</label>
              <textarea id="w3" placeholder="Concerns about time, privacy, talking about things, etc."></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="4">
              <label>Practical details that matter (insurance, times, remote vs in-person)</label>
              <textarea id="w4" placeholder="Any constraints or preferences"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="prevStep" type="button">Back</button>
              <button class="btn" id="nextStep" type="button">Next</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="resetWizard" type="button">Start over</button>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="summary" id="wizardSummary">Complete the steps to build your intake notes.</div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button class="btn" id="generateSummary">Generate notes</button>
                <button class="btn secondary" id="copyWizard">Copy notes</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h3>
          <p class="small">You can call or email to request a consultation.</p>
          <p class="small"><strong>Phone:</strong> {{PHONE}}<br/><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Membership / Continuity Options</h4>
            <p class="small">I offer a continuity enrollment model with two tracks: a focused short-series (4–8 sessions) for specific concerns, and an ongoing support tier for steady check-ins. Fees and enrollment details are discussed during the initial consult. See Investment for full details.</p>
            <a class="btn" href="fees.html">View options</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Confidentiality & scope</h4>
          <p class="small">Communications via email are treated with professional discretion. Formal therapy involves informed consent, limits to confidentiality (such as risk of harm), and an agreed plan. Initial messages do not create a therapeutic relationship.</p>
          <div class="important" style="margin-top:10px">
            <strong>Crisis note:</strong>
            <p class="small" style="margin:6px 0 0 0">If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a life-threatening crisis, call emergency services or your local crisis line. I cannot provide emergency services through this site or by email.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <span style="font-size:0.9rem">Private practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span></div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem">Licensed clinician. Confidentiality, scope, and crisis information above.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // footer year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Contact form primary CTA behaviour — builds a short message summary (not sending email locally)
    document.getElementById('primaryContact').addEventListener('click', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value.trim();
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){
        alert('Please provide name and email.');
        return;
      }
      const summary = [];
      summary.push('Contact request from: ' + name);
      summary.push('Email: ' + email);
      if(phone) summary.push('Phone: ' + phone);
      if(message) summary.push('Note: ' + message);
      summary.push('Preferred next step: Consultation to discuss options and membership tracks.');

      // Fill plan summary for convenience
      const planSummary = document.getElementById('planSummary');
      planSummary.textContent = summary.join('\n');
      alert('Prepared your message summary. You can copy it from the Session Planner summary area and paste it into email or the scheduling form.');
    });

    document.getElementById('clearForm').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    });

    // Session Planner logic
    function getSelectedRhythm(){
      const radios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name="rhythm"]');
      for(const r of radios) if(r.checked) return r.value;
      return 'Weekly';
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const focus = document.getElementById('focus').value;
      const rhythm = getSelectedRhythm();
      const goal1 = document.getElementById('goal1').value.trim();
      const goal2 = document.getElementById('goal2').value.trim();
      const constraints = document.getElementById('constraints').value;

      const lines = [];
      lines.push('Session Plan — personalized summary');
      lines.push('Focus: ' + focus);
      lines.push('Rhythm: ' + rhythm);
      if(goal1) lines.push('Short-term goal 1: ' + goal1);
      if(goal2) lines.push('Short-term goal 2: ' + goal2);
      lines.push('Constraints: ' + constraints);
      lines.push('\nSuggested next step: Bring this summary to an initial consult. We can adapt the rhythm and goals if needed.');

      document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent = lines.join('\n');
    });

    document.getElementById('resetPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.getElementById('focus').selectedIndex = 0;
      document.getElementById('goal1').value = '';
      document.getElementById('goal2').value = '';
      document.getElementById('constraints').selectedIndex = 0;
      document.querySelector('input[name="rhythm"]').checked = true;
      document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent = 'Your session plan will appear here.';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const text = document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent;
      if(!text){ alert('No plan to copy.'); return; }
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
        alert('Summary copied to clipboard.');
      }, function(){ alert('Copy failed. You can select and copy manually.'); });
    });

    // Wizard logic
    (function(){
      const steps = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-step'));
      const indicator = document.getElementById('stepsIndicator');
      let idx = 0;
      function renderIndicator(){
        indicator.innerHTML = '';
        steps.forEach((s,i)=>{
          const dot = document.createElement('div');
          dot.className = 'step-dot' + (i===idx? ' active':'');
          indicator.appendChild(dot);
        });
      }
      function showStep(i){
        steps.forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('active'));
        steps[i].classList.add('active');
        idx = i;
        renderIndicator();
      }
      renderIndicator();
      showStep(0);

      document.getElementById('nextStep').addEventListener('click', function(){
        if(idx < steps.length - 1) showStep(idx+1);
      });
      document.getElementById('prevStep').addEventListener('click', function(){
        if(idx > 0) showStep(idx-1);
      });
      document.getElementById('resetWizard').addEventListener('click', function(){
        steps.forEach(s=>{ const ta = s.querySelector('textarea'); if(ta) ta.value = ''; });
        showStep(0);
        document.getElementById('wizardSummary').textContent = 'Complete the steps to build your intake notes.';
      });

      function buildWizardNotes(){
        const a0 = document.getElementById('w0').value.trim();
        const a1 = document.getElementById('w1').value.trim();
        const a2 = document.getElementById('w2').value.trim();
        const a3 = document.getElementById('w3').value.trim();
        const a4 = document.getElementById('w4').value.trim();

        const lines = [];
        lines.push('Intake notes — prepared by client');
        lines.push('\n1) Why now:');
        lines.push(a0 || '—');
        lines.push('\n2) Current experiences:');
        lines.push(a1 || '—');
        lines.push('\n3) What has helped previously:');
        lines.push(a2 || '—');
        lines.push('\n4) Concerns about starting therapy:');
        lines.push(a3 || '—');
        lines.push('\n5) Practical details:');
        lines.push(a4 || '—');

        lines.push('\nSuggested questions to bring to a consult:');
        lines.push('- How might we structure an initial short series to address my primary concern?');
        lines.push('- What would you recommend if scheduling or budget become constraints?');
        lines.push('- How do you handle confidentiality and communication outside sessions?');
        lines.push('- What goals would you prioritize in the first 2–3 sessions?');

        return lines.join('\n');
      }

      document.getElementById('generateSummary').addEventListener('click', function(){
        const notes = buildWizardNotes();
        document.getElementById('wizardSummary').textContent = notes;
        // jump to end
        showStep(steps.length-1);
      });

      document.getElementById('copyWizard').addEventListener('click', function(){
        const text = document.getElementById('wizardSummary').textContent;
        if(!text){ alert('No notes to copy.'); return; }
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
          alert('Notes copied to clipboard.');
        }, function(){ alert('Copy failed. You can select and copy manually.'); });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and utilities for the private practice template.

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — The contact page with interactive tools and practice info.

Purpose:
- contact.html contains an accessible contact form (local, non-sending), a Session Planner widget, and a Self-Screening Intake Wizard.

Features:
- Session Planner: Select focus, rhythm, short-term goals, and constraints. Click "Create plan" to generate a plaintext summary in the plan area. Use "Copy summary" to copy to clipboard and paste into email or a scheduling form.
- Self-Screening Intake Wizard: A multi-step, non-diagnostic intake helper that prompts for reason for seeking help, current experiences, past helpful strategies, concerns about starting therapy, and practical details. "Generate notes" compiles responses and provides suggested consult questions. "Copy notes" copies the generated text.

Notes for use:
- All interactions are local to the page; no data is transmitted by the included scripts.
- Replace placeholders in the HTML (e.g. {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}) with your practice details.
- The contact form's primary CTA prepares a brief message summary in the Session Planner area for convenience; it does not send an email.

Clinical and compliance reminders (content included in contact.html):
- The page includes confidentiality/context language, scope boundaries, and a clear crisis note. Do not present the wizard as diagnostic or as emergency care.
- Avoid making guarantees or medical claims in replaced copy.

Accessibility & progressive enhancement:
- The page uses simple HTML form controls and ARIA-live regions for generated summaries so screen reader users receive updates.
- Copy-to-clipboard uses the Clipboard API with graceful alert fallbacks.

Customization tips:
- You can adapt the Session Planner options, add more goals, or connect the contact form to a secure practice management system.
- If you host an assets SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg, the header attempts a subtle patterned look; you can replace or extend styles in the head of contact.html.

Developer notes:
- This bundle intentionally keeps all JS inline to avoid external dependencies. For production, move scripts into a module file and add proper form submission handlers secured by a practice backend.
- Keep crisis guidance prominent and unchanged to meet ethical expectations.

End of README."}
BUNDLE_END
